  "description": "21-year-old Kim Chul-soo, who is about to enlist in the military, is filled with worries, especially regarding his lack of romantic and sexual experience. One day, he strikes up a conversation with his neighbor, 33-year-old Lee Na-hee, and is invited to her home for dinner out of her kindness. As they spend time together and he opens up about his anxieties, Chul-soo reveals his inner feelings and makes an unexpected proposal, causing a subtle tension to grow between the two.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5700001121), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14368603), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000079641)",
